menu "Example: On/Off Light"

    config EXAMPLE_LIGHT_GPIO
        int "Light GPIO"
        range 0 30
        default 15
        help
            GPIO driven by the OnOff attribute. The default, GPIO15, is the
            user LED on a Seeed XIAO ESP32-C6 (a strapping pin, but safe to
            drive after boot). With a XIAO antenna option selected, do not
            use GPIO3/GPIO14.

    config EXAMPLE_LIGHT_ACTIVE_LOW
        bool "Light is active-low"
        default y
        help
            Set when the output turns the light on by driving LOW (true for
            the XIAO ESP32-C6 user LED). Clear for an active-high LED/driver.

endmenu
